WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:16.400
The Whispering Chasm. A corridor of red stone where every echo answers late.

2
00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:22.400
I carried the lamp, the staff and the Order's page of sums.

3
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.400
At the far end the walls opened onto white light. It was not real.

4
00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:37.600
The Salt Playa. A white sea of stone plates, and the Study's rule: test each plate before you trust it.

5
00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:43.600
Every hexagon lies with its edges. The honest one holds when you lean.

6
00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:50.600
Seven plates, seven truths. The line of the Order ran straight to a post in the middle of the salt.

7
00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:56.600
C, R, Y, S, T, A, L. The rings turned, and the post opened.

8
00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:02.600
Beyond the stones lay the Sump, where the crust changes with every noon.

9
00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:07.600
I knelt and read the ridges, the seams and the cracks, as the Study teaches.

10
00:01:08.600 --> 00:01:14.400
Far to the south, a caravan crossed the haze without a sound.

11
00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:21.600
Sand at last. And on the marker's foot, a glyph I had never seen: the letter Q.

12
00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:28.600
Camp VII, the nomad ruins, under a sky full of stars.

13
00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:33.600
Two men kept the watch. We cleaned the words in silence, and the dial woke.

14
00:01:34.800 --> 00:01:40.400
Z. Another glyph of the Order. And the night had only begun.

